    44	          <p className="mt-6 text-lg text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
    45	            Your emissions data is sensitive — it tells the world how your business runs.
    46	            We treat it that way. Here's exactly how we protect it.
