    81	              'Session timeout and automatic re-authentication',
    82	            ]}
    83	          />
    84	          <TrustCard
    85	            icon={<DataIcon />}
    86	            title="Data Handling"
    87	            items={[
    88	              'Your data is yours. We never share or sell customer data.',
    89	              'Document processing: files parsed, factors applied, source deleted on schedule',
    90	              'Data retention policies configurable per workspace',
    91	              'GDPR-compliant data processing agreement available',
    92	            ]}
    93	          />
    94	          <TrustCard
    95	            icon={<ComplianceIcon />}
    96	            title="Compliance"
    97	            items={[
    98	              'SOC 2 Type II audit in progress (Q3 2026)',
    99	              'GDPR compliant — DPA available on request',
   100	              'California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) compliant',
   101	              'Carbon accounting methodology follows GHG Protocol',
   102	            ]}
   103	          />
   104	          <TrustCard
   105	            icon={<BackupIcon />}
   106	            title="Backup & Recovery"
   107	            items={[
   108	              'Automated daily backups with 30-day retention',
   109	              'Cross-region backup replication',
   110	              'Point-in-time recovery (PITR) for databases',
   111	              'Disaster recovery plan tested quarterly',
   112	            ]}
   113	          />
   114	        </div>
   115	      </section>
   116	
   117	      {/* ─── Data handling details ─── */}
   118	      <section className="border-t border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900">
   119	        <div className="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">
   120	          <div className="text-center mb-10">
   121	            <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">How we handle your data</h2>
   122	            <p className="mt-3 text-surface-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Transparency about what happens to your uploaded documents, extracted data, and generated reports.</p>
   123	          </div>
   124	          <div className="space-y-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
   125	            {[
   126	              { q: 'Document upload and processing', a: 'When you upload a utility bill, invoice, or freight document, the file is encrypted and stored temporarily. Our AI extracts relevant data points (usage amounts, dates, provider names) and applies emission factors. Source documents can be auto-deleted after extraction based on your retention policy (default: 90 days).' },
   127	              { q: 'Data sharing and third parties', a: 'We never share, sell, or license your emissions data to third parties. Data you upload is used exclusively to provide the Service — generating emissions estimates, audit trails, and compliance reports. We do not train AI models on customer data. Integrations with QuickBooks, Xero, or other platforms are read-only where possible and require explicit OAuth authorization.' },
   128	              { q: 'Employee and contractor access', a: 'Production access is restricted to authorized engineering and support staff, requires multi-factor authentication, and is logged and audited monthly. Support staff access customer data only to resolve specific, documented support requests with workspace owner consent.' },
   129	              { q: 'Data deletion on cancellation', a: 'When a subscription is canceled, customer data is retained for 90 days to allow for export and transition. After this period, all customer data is securely deleted from production systems, backups, and disaster recovery storage. Customers can request expedited deletion at any time.' },
