   146	          <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">Trust documentation</h2>
   147	          <p className="mt-3 text-surface-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We publish our security and compliance documentation transparently. NoNDA required for standard materials.</p>
   148	        </div>
   149	        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
   150	          {[
